              For Gaussian beam: A&middot;&Omega;&nbsp;=&nbsp;M<sup>4</sup>&lambda;&sup2;, so
              B&nbsp;=&nbsp;P/(M<sup>4</sup>&lambda;&sup2;&Delta;&lambda;).
